{
  "$doc": "docs/DESIGN_Temperament_And_Stress.md \u00a76 (CE-2272) \u2014 ts-three-defenders, the scenario's Judge list: (1) the Coward breaks (Stress.Broken) and runs (task Break), he does not surrender; (2) the Waverer breaks with a rifle on him and surrenders (task Surrender); (3) the Fanatic never breaks or surrenders and fires back. \u26a0 Left out: (4) the printed stress/time figures (not a condition). The Coward and Waverer rows are the same ones the rail CE2272_TsThreeDefenders pins in-process.",
